  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/87fcf9a67ecb405a2fb5d03ae8bf16b237df2b9390a1aaaff447816870f4524af5af391bd520a99765cd959750bb308718550e8bc16df17f53bb0f73ea58cb00\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e99c7d0cfc1e671a2334cd7308d7c415b4a71d8193c5a8655c41e48b1f59523c40039c832243a1482b00fc4c78cd4fbc3d81bd3b04b0a11c382d1df55c37e72856bba5b90d13\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/babc1fad67b528187c3301af9f190ab887ff1e05b09ff838f2f830c6f68435906b06d7b2db45336add39c753eab18e3d3999120d778d10c375849e5d751d8751c7a57496abaecbb0d54077785bb8f2fe31f8340d839ffc17ee7ffaa5814f09dbeb094477161471722afc38dbade8c7a23973d8cd27b94880\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/86a755f61d9cc4da2d0fccb7b7c6f41ee9f62f816534d91f90f623443544c99357ae31133a6fbd1effb02b25de2e4fb7e9d64640c4a882b28d429737907280305ee576eba0cc8940b9af860e2e3dc227203a775dac856a5b16edca31300f5b9a2b780f93d177fddd427afb2396188edecd85a4fb13e9abe3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/47e8e7dc84542e2d303e56c139f013da6517a9e6ffc4c342078aad2772460ce55e6303a28de010bba48fa9cc4913ef03f2f0520d30d5f23ef50a2ef6d425fb8ef51df9f0d9ba8f456078b8e4117a0dc3fb34e110a12dd7d423807766f4b7489f10c848ae6a3f925415e342dbc766fc0e45eeacb865ad8679\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/984bafeef22dc4e8cae7f4d69c73a8c9ec79fb36790daa6334c4bbfeb7ab1b06f9358cfbd573f38bfded2d6135c3a5443a615709a81828ae76cea257f1b70b65e9c283c3976ac66f6172beb80aa8711bc7a585a0f951ef27d531ab2d510f81f23ae50e368a9cb8cf31987050cb2824cfd247337c39615c2d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/82f77fcd793cd61ccd656c5408e42d54a544a586d427603ed736ebe923088ab17e77b3662ad50e370a03d7fd4623132037a14bdb5ab3c475622336c8ecf72ca2e3b2fe50561af2e84dbbc7c5375b049b3d3cd4cafcc3fcda5a4719fcb825a6b405cbe05e0d8bcf13221ecb483cd6e21d6083f6011b57c2bd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5486a1e7de12c9dd1770f88d9244ae33b7d75e76ab150f05490df5f66fbe37c4b86dcd9aee9ee00ce7a76a208022f6e8e684f6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8c6bb469e7922bfc08bc8d8eb200908ad698eb74579a6eaa6f3e8489dea3f08872decf8b9d182bd7bd2f9243aef33f1f0dcfee53268bf4bc9929c728d09c245cfd17f9af1c2ee0b09dfd1f86da188f25f6e3bea424e5474409afc6578a6001f937c1b125f87e462c5487289ab3bc54f25776971c4cef6d18\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/627c52ce32fdc3f3ad516402ee3a80dac5d54f7348e057b7d55832f08348a5b31a0cfc8c895bdc9d16892f8429b9c7d88ed7363420b36d167c464be0f8cc96fe8f352f95aea7f47011a74c0abdd216da3254904cda2f6620b194ad456594772e6a51c3e187f9790a29da7945ba7403395049ebaea90568c3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2dd526712c352d40ef875aca78583731119975737f8a51cb1aa769f76ab494d0167f08ef297d1630553d3c9d5af9549f7844df5844e67505d0228fe0ef439213fe6fba47a855663ab73125504940d8d2fe219056420e93c6e17e9929bb433da2d6ee64a22fbb8ab78cca8469484f5c5563b9c86ce5e5fbbc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/83a1ba01f3f05d0b6a28c9d1b65a4d5523029a4634eba6d72fefd7c7b388f64c909b0d5c9b8f24ca49b977d7e960ac09c4201224170ce5782106df98f048e007c80b61218361f00110e998a142cfee53805bf336e9306d1ee73af97e4b58ae262ac2c89528535f078e4719c71dc8feaacecaaa23985e62d5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2dfd0febbc3d5cf6e8190ac1ec9beac2414aa574cf99278d98ab32ae29c50c12a9df1afa8d90213429d5c3fcf60613e5162f0eb63b1c1b19ce19d6dc519cb828da6face1f60ad3e41c85eeda4a0c2a6de0210615a5743ea5cdaf0fdfa49ac9f11027b588a76da51502838b5168f5b4aebdda3c7944b06f39\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6b00fe2a94398d7ab27b5ae0a1d4f50aea38baf48267c68667453310e7c42f09c39da126fdb0f74e77b2705bf365d6773ccfcf2395b7b01bd54d20fc01b15d5045f4bcc04bd380d6c3a412df93308efddd592ca8b49b243ac4f3b2bffd35182481a7e07fa8861c76e05dd6fa02b09af6ae8c36805fd04eb1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a26660d60ba65403c3139d0b14e6a77381e3bd3ffb8ecebb6f3d07c9019707a88ac07ef42c5f6a5c253e8e0ef295356b5ede7d4f5eb68f591004c9dd5d8f336889a142b35bfd658a111611bff737d2b7f10e0fc2daefaef9819462ebb90c67f9655cd6864890379d60d775c894d7065d7c6f417b4535ba17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/70ae7c50708f78a774feea084d6b22496aa03e3b3b76e738de97a88e116177ec462d2f46285fe6abbd5a56a5f92ad719e11ce10c8a49692ed462a8a08b21209fd4976e6011617b5d1da599f0eb77d2fcd0689174837dbc6af95f7f2ea79008a9448313b1b8b029de37e221d16a0432d7ae33f1ff3b8298fc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/703155b9c179be0b55634dccfb3942ea56e1e282da2ff9903289b96381d7dc9e63a5aa479efb423730a8fd72cb080d290b2fefd191afcf895ff33bc43d9422b437ca41bd43a0be848dc56dfe7f0d2feb10321a99a8945cbc3ac1645c53d4adb98be68f3084160a357b008e04c5667d6c548eb4aea34ded78\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c9a0d69c0702848e9dd75cfd1be893e86d26bbcb6aa16b49793c007ba1ef0a3a50b8caa137f1510d6af055da2c7dc53b2ec522a0763a865d3d45e239dadf55218769a7773e94d6e4fa73a4fd4e754f040d05aab214117dadffcdf12de6883479f84c8dc560b0cc7e98aaf1aa7ed0ea7c53def4d702bf1401\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/151d13e619299e1da71392c926d04678bb298620f4afa9ec7a2a03ea6cc99339f4f63bab40031f567490e92c39612eea45e44f7a6af06f6fd09736ed648a712c9c7e12b34913e0386e9c1cccea120789483fe99d7086cce834f834f4dc7fe58f81ffdf8879218c4190e009c9f4433bb9aea15a2293fa37ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8ec282140ffa2ad0406e21536fce6c3fe404829e7b77261fd5f15a749b5f716f6836a8736d14fefe7bd073a33aefc7cc7fd497296a2b8ef161fad3143f9b595322112c91e9ac7ccc41a4036a53620595536e027c01b316ade4e344973b3564f4b016422a042def542fc4b21ce27d4a1a839c42d335b61486\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2801b88fd3ef60cb5e5b1e9897253a0a8f4b8930db3208645172c021d385ba715899c5be84e3a2a98f193629e47b42283d03f516fe2e6a9e4127dc8e4a5ff83b9f84a6d1bbf6e39d503266b05cd48ee31149fcac945667ce6d0fc8c15830ae256dd87db69c2b7f030c79921b3bf3a359029321d47488d72c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1d3ba0aef9042b85277f0236ff1da17fd45bfc68ad25316c5083cdebb3501f29772e2bef8bf7f31900c489db37cfdf203f21f27b0a3fe6627cf50d3f6f2f2efe644ae1a53c3e5e53b93dfa23492442e383b7746e156e3736737cd3d9459524b82b1d90c8f3dab95a48269f4f390b6854e3556e7d2e1b5df2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/be0724f70ecad4241e6091be3fcbfcd23c13884e4d6294ec821f8634954e389530f7a49bd0bfe13ae2ebbd327e2f826d5fa6b15775ed1dcb85329c2875dc3605ede23b2b5d431029dcb4f0aad8980e0104152b705df122e1d2213f6295c97d340fe560d143ba107107599149507f92db8d29db074ec814f1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d290ec074f773df7fbcb9eaedc54c4d4f3c2e5bad7d13e8e0c1fe812da916b4eeee1f8c60a7f29da067385250288fd2df19380c79e62cecf1a1b60f615dfea10d2cab416c82530f4a13ea0e40fcb107d050fe3af450625ced1edbe7f640550f93b61c2a13c3c03f6152c4d04cdab8fb76f55e67d00ea491b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ff12fe7a85f736a15cea8e3e60003bf71e0b6521033577a0bc19318cc28f848842c2a92ff235a56eb344545ed288222e0b57a1804855168a685da14b52418fc4de0edeeb0db8d9ecac10729e7bc2bd84ab47ba5d8dd17eb90d103a5946d03d7eb462d6e600ad2e9d9010c413e89c6847a02c5a37efcac251\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3830ffc670ca171a2fa314909a899581043d86aba9ad30f0eb16eaab18f482865da08ecb57bdd519a9795b7f181099302d28362d33913f5911fc516ff0c523fd0db81afdbf584e7fadca3424d695823bc99f39432773d74c8be05437bddf4905ff7db849c7cf7048aa41576e70c1997dbb47bbcf85e372d6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c88201ccf159c616ebd8525db20a84c1b70fae032852ad28d21bf6f61fe45f1bbd934bf8606d44ae4cd71ba35ebc1f4d72821e635f3d7ea694380070a85a0e64449f06beb91d63079e1e8a36e4bbd5de3c43103b6e24e085b38e78ce9e8741f7fda534636efcccb658e7e754ab7ababf77a8bcb0b8a861a7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b51c5373040741759bb3f1414cce0b4f2fe3fd07eb216f724383830eba1910ef3d36e7b32b00d8048e0a6cc2a60c6b3cb9a146d138f1ece6181be4c2efa2befd0ccf0bbf1ff72c627410457b9580864cf0883c7dc72a19ba62d260\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/851b55cb0d178cda1f5cad76b22df5294e951a09e6b63d185ba52b2a0f1322d6703d45bb9fbdd4a85ba739a475bfa83103293c828509919a6db167caa7a9acd7cc92a004982e2c9fee0fa19e30bd6021be3ae338bdebe35e69bc4589647b62185d6d5156531be51e3fc097c6da41549ea09a93658f89e294\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f36a56b05b103f1c5c7a27c5698d47ca667df245899702408b959782d551ee8a507153948d2417316d8c1d18a1670bc08b2e04f3ff9c647d21012cae9d343e45b3d06900203f3771bc211eca6ddb1d3521e4943c363a6e8e8c9088d6f920a4bc0e54138b378ad12b3d1d1e786a08d75025dd8c8f9a7536c7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6b547cf6b126249798c612bf65bf90c0dd39fd62f779a8b065440aeb5f68f74ff030113de0478af052cbcec42521e4ef989a104095b987bbe572d0e1900f07f65e6b677249df374533c6640d98d23ee3e952a4a428b67710ac6d2cac255a217c8ea16dabe4e02209be5849ec20804331ad145f0e3ee29e41\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b1de2a87fd63144128cbe658d2e1a8df62e42e6ae163f009aa54602db89c5d34e642856ce8867236f73cc0a4384dbf6ac9933e84ad46c34dc4dec2c7f803a2c67edef0edb5086def6654d1f76dadbd77f2f4f3f0a9bb24636a5ed7c5b343c13430ec340f6cb9acbdac110529dd91dace14d5dd7995408a42\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/506e47e49bbde2b65dbc0e1090079fd38014757e79b73988c22a7670749ae8d11322343186acffccff200861f1ab3e7508faafeafbb2dec2e5e0d757618675da2b9f024e7b9554200e5ff10833812bb0284e467445785419be1fe2e918a6a61f81101c11d61c66883ef872f8e0f9c5cef3e351d7cbd2930b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a8c0307e0c545c1dedf09ef37e24e244b86b2cc9ed414d7709493b1db1699434b8833e148032c7e380c08ad4d619761d09067bb1f4bdeb8eba1755e2720a839fda4047ce9811b5b41b569d29dfd58d8b0228e03823ed24372cc4ad9bd38137c59e17d943af6253b68df55dcdbcc18604f04b548107cf58f5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c27afcd25dc2d661b50a8b7e1bd6a86f44b6f6ac72b94ff050ae7dd8c7a457e190d36eb65df74db360f2198e013c3ff61ab693209ff333fde13c87e4101b872a99308b3e3099c54d5d42ce6b787d2759919d94c5f26b1ed6bbc50833a6f76153e8881158f5367213966d27d0d825919c0de11cb592402542\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
